WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:21.397
The old tree wasn't good for Bird.

2
00:00:21.398 --> 00:00:25.876
The maple tree wasn't good for Kip.

3
00:00:25.877 --> 00:00:29.739
"This is terrible," said Bird.

4
00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:32.732
"Where are we going to live?"

5
00:00:32.733 --> 00:00:39.453
Kip thought for a moment.

6
00:00:39.454 --> 00:00:43.482
"I know!" he said.

7
00:00:43.483 --> 00:00:46.124
"I can live in this old tree.

8
00:00:46.125 --> 00:00:49.069
You can live in the maple tree."

9
00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:51.473
Bird's eyes lit up.

10
00:00:51.474 --> 00:01:00.386
"We'll each have our own tree!" she said.

11
00:01:00.387 --> 00:01:06.450
Kip cleaned a hole in the old tree.

12
00:01:06.451 --> 00:01:12.975
Bird built a nest in the maple tree.

13
00:01:12.976 --> 00:01:15.577
Bird looked over at Kip.

14
00:01:15.578 --> 00:01:21.699
"How does my new nest look?" she called.

15
00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:25.322
"What did you say?" called Kip.

16
00:01:25.323 --> 00:01:28.420
"What?" called Bird.

17
00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:32.141
"I can't hear you!" called Kip.

18
00:01:32.142 --> 00:01:35.506
"What?" called Bird.

19
00:01:35.507 --> 00:01:46.244
Kip sighed and went over to Bird.

20
00:01:46.245 --> 00:01:50.376
"This was a bad idea, Bird," said Kip.

21
00:01:50.377 --> 00:01:53.279
"Let's fix our old tree."

22
00:01:53.280 --> 00:02:08.487
Bird smiled. "Good idea, Kip."
